 ∞€   ﬁ  Software protection emulator for Adobe products.                           ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ                                                                             ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  The tool implements all necessary fucntions required by Abobe's            ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  apps activation and features unlocking. It is based on native API          ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  and optimized for the best performance. So the whole protection mechanism  ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  will be replaced by a dll with only 70Kb in size.                          ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ                                                                             ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  Software protection emulator has the following benefits:                   ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  1. It does not require AAM (Adobe Application Manager).                    ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  2. It does not perform a background license check while the user is        ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ     saving files/using menus/any other operation in Adobe apps.             ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  3. All possible features will become available in all                      ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ     installed Adobe apps.                                                   ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  4. It does not require Administrator's right/elevation to run the app      ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ     and does not require any kind of registration in the operating system.  ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  5. It does not create/modify/update the Abobe application database,        ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ     so it will not be used by the emulator at all.                          ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  6. It does not send statistics to Adobe.                                   ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  7. It does not create license labels and license cache.                    ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  8. It bypasses all regional limitations.                                   ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  9. It disables all kind of tracking (logging) for all apps.                ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ                                                                             ›   €∞
 ∞€     ﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂﬂ     €∞
