 ∞€   ﬁ  =Option #1=                                                                ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  1.  Install the required Adobe software in a Virtual Machine.              ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  2.  Pick the installed application from the list or specify its version,   ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      name and ID manually. This data is required for some app's features    ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      and will be used as a stub.                                            ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  3.  Locate the untouched amtlib.dll. It will be replaced automatically     ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      with the appropriate 32-bit/64-bit emulator file, depending on the     ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      installed operating system version.                                    ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  4.  Copy the installed app (%ProgramFiles%\Adobe\%App% [to x86]) and all   ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      extense files if they exist, for instance, old versions of Photoshop   ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      require the TypeSupport files (%CommonProgramFiles%\Adobe              ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      \TypeSupport [to x86]) from VM to the host operating system.           ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  5.  Now you can use your application.                                      ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ                                                                             ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  =Option #2=                                                                ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  1.  To install the emulator, select the required Adobe app from            ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      the list or specify its version, name and ID manually. This data is    ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      required for some app's features and will be used as a stub.           ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  2.1 Locate the untouched amtlib.dll. It will be replaced automatically     ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      with the appropriate 32-bit/64-bit emulator file, depending on         ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      the installed operating system version.                                ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ  2.2 [Optionally] Remove all protection files and AAM to disable            ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      the tracking and update check:                                         ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      = %CommonProgramFiles%\Adobe\OOBE    =                                 ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      = %CommonProgramFiles%\Adobe\SLCache =                                 ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      = %LocalAppData%\Adobe\OOBE          =                                 ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      = %LocalAppData%\Adobe\AAMUpdater    =                                 ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      = %ProgramData%\Adobe\SLStore        =                                 ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      = %ProgramData%\Adobe\AAMUpdater\1.0 =                                 ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      = %Temp%\*.log                       =                                 ›   €∞
 ∞€   ﬁ      = and so on.                         =                                 ›   €∞
